hardcoded-credential,error,Credential variable set to literal value,Variable 'Password' has a name that suggests it holds a credential and is assigned a literal string value.,"Store credentials in a secured vault, Windows Credential Manager, or use a PAD input variable instead of a literal string in the flow.",Preview rules,flows/preview/Main.txt,b-001,sf-1,2,hardcoded-credential:464c56f389b63631,Security
hardcoded-url,info,Hardcoded URL,Property 'Url' contains a hardcoded URL: http://example.com/status,Store the base URL in a variable so it can be changed per environment without editing the flow.,Preview rules,flows/preview/Main.txt,b-002,sf-1,3,hardcoded-url:d3e3110436d64cb6,Portability
insecure-http-url,warning,Insecure HTTP URL,"Action targets a cleartext http:// URL. Any data sent (credentials, tokens, PII) travels unencrypted and is interceptable on the wire.",Use the https:// scheme for the target endpoint so transport is TLS-encrypted.,Preview rules,flows/preview/Main.txt,b-002,sf-1,3,insecure-http-url:d3e3110436d64cb6,Security
missing-retry,info,Transient operation without retry,"This network/external service action is prone to transient failures (timeouts, rate limits, connection resets) but has no retry mechanism or error handler.","Wrap this action in a loop with a retry counter and delay, or add an 'On Block Error' handler that implements retry logic.",Preview rules,flows/preview/Main.txt,b-002,sf-1,3,missing-retry:bc169b9f27eba1be,Reliability
missing-timeout,warning,Network operation without timeout,"This network/UI automation action has no explicit timeout configured. If the target is unresponsive, the flow will hang indefinitely.","Set an explicit timeout value in the action's properties. For web automation, use 'Wait for element' with a timeout instead of relying on default behavior.",Preview rules,flows/preview/Main.txt,b-002,sf-1,3,missing-timeout:bc169b9f27eba1be,Reliability
unhandled-error,warning,Unhandled error in fallible action,This action commonly fails but has no error handler in its surrounding scope.,Wrap this action in a Try/Catch block or add error handler logic to recover from failures.,Preview rules,flows/preview/Main.txt,b-002,sf-1,3,unhandled-error:bc169b9f27eba1be,Reliability
uninitialized-variable,warning,Variable potentially uninitialized,Variable 'Browser' is used here but doesn't seem to be assigned anywhere in the flow.,Ensure the variable is initialized with a SET action or as an output of another action.,Preview rules,flows/preview/Main.txt,b-002,sf-1,3,uninitialized-variable:a0027d794ec56617,Logic
unused-variable,info,Variable declared but never used,This variable is set but never referenced elsewhere in the flow.,Remove the unused variable or add a reference to it.,Preview rules,flows/preview/Main.txt,b-001,sf-1,2,unused-variable:464c56f389b63631,Style
